{
  "work_id": "wb-glosses/1thess",
  "source_path": "wb-glosses/1thess.json",
  "source_language": "sga",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01": {
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-11-01",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24b.32",
      "source_sha256": "b58b00d2bd1da251",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "a lamp"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24c.1",
      "source_sha256": "b4333a70710c1a07",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. because you are faithful"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24c.2",
      "source_sha256": "322e3c6bb615c7da",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. that is a sign of great love which he declares: without ceasing in prayer, without ceasing"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24c.3",
      "source_sha256": "e15707ce17e0d73e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. you yourselves see it"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24c.4",
      "source_sha256": "04ca0d9d065a1097",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. it is for your advancement, so that you may be in the body of Christ"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24c.5",
      "source_sha256": "41d43ec17060ee42",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. it was not a matter of words only, but there were also miracles to confirm it"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24c.6",
      "source_sha256": "271149b23fb71337",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. in the perfection of righteousness of conduct and life, or in the fullness of knowledge of the divinity and humanity of Christ"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24c.7",
      "source_sha256": "85ee89188e698dab",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. there is no need to recount it to you"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24c.8",
      "source_sha256": "21866b2a8ca40ca7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. so that you have taken an example from us"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24c.9",
      "source_sha256": "54d973e9ec4c89c2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. in preaching and fulfilling the gospel"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24c.10",
      "source_sha256": "075dfe2c3c00e69d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. 'imitators': it seemed too lofty to him to say to them 'the likeness of God' straightaway, but even so this is how it came about [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24c.11",
      "source_sha256": "b90fbdb17a0ffd06",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "reception"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24c.12",
      "source_sha256": "6741280347ea7008",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. in many tribulations, i.e. from your fellow citizens"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24c.13",
      "source_sha256": "ddd5864b09fa516e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. you rejoiced through the grace of the Spirit in receiving it"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24c.14",
      "source_sha256": "17ceae664a4a0d83",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. example: i.e. so that it is from you that everyone has taken an example"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24c.15",
      "source_sha256": "2f19669da41a547e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. your faith is famous in every place"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24c.16",
      "source_sha256": "c8849833e7069d3c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. we have no need to give testimony about ourselves; it is you yourselves who give it anyway [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24c.17",
      "source_sha256": "89455caab3133752",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. you preached to them with such zeal [?] that you told them how we preached and how we came to you at the beginning"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24c.18",
      "source_sha256": "b4ba933b76d77b85",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Since he has saved us from sin, we are certain that he will save us in the future"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24c.19",
      "source_sha256": "4d0fa7bc2becaaac",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. it was not without tribulations and anxieties"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24c.20",
      "source_sha256": "fe2236198bfd47b9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. reproaches from everyone"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24c.21",
      "source_sha256": "0d9fdc49836510db",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. among the Philippians"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24c.22",
      "source_sha256": "02a947b58210576b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. it was [known] to you, though we were not among you [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24d.1",
      "source_sha256": "9630d0a442dbeaf2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I do not preach for reward or payment, as the false apostles do"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24d.2",
      "source_sha256": "f1b46b5d96dba545",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. we did not take an earthly reward"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24d.3",
      "source_sha256": "def6b2985c3d73ff",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "It is not for praise that we have done it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24d.4",
      "source_sha256": "a505eded5c8a19e0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. we would not have preached as it would have been pleasing to men; 'if I were pleasing men, I would not be the servant of Christ.'"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24d.5",
      "source_sha256": "ab54677fa7e175f1",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. it is he who knows how we preach."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24d.6",
      "source_sha256": "0f400e4886743870",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. not so that we might earn thanks from anyone."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24d.7",
      "source_sha256": "79dd2d1f643f6118",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. it was not a seeking after wealth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24d.8",
      "source_sha256": "154b30f445943a1e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "God knows it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24d.9",
      "source_sha256": "9ec24989f5a1fd14",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "as messengers of an exalted person."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24d.10",
      "source_sha256": "625cdc648b6563c4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "As every [?] does that in teaching his foster-child every perfect deed, he has done [?] of us in teaching a foster-child."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24d.11",
      "source_sha256": "c94325cab9c1d78d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Question: are 'little one' (parvulus) and 'nurse' (nutrix) the same to him? Yes indeed [?], it is the same, for it is the custom of nurses: she makes a little weakling of herself in teaching her foster-child, because she desires that infancy should not remain on him for long. 'So were we to you,' says Paul."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24d.12",
      "source_sha256": "bb86452dfe219856",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. its preaching and its fulfilment."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24d.13",
      "source_sha256": "6b6595f7579687d4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. so that the glory might be the same for our souls; or, for your sake in martyrdom."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24d.14",
      "source_sha256": "ecffc0cf1b7d6044",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Making ropes by night, which he sold for food and clothing for his household; preaching by day to save the souls of many."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24d.15",
      "source_sha256": "021d877586e37b59",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. without diminishing you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24d.16",
      "source_sha256": "4c8733ddf56364f6",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. as we have recounted."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24d.17",
      "source_sha256": "659a4962cf9352b9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. it is certain to you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24d.18",
      "source_sha256": "4d0050e0fc54ba3b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "[?] i.e. in chastity."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24d.19",
      "source_sha256": "0aed92ff485b666a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. as a father entreats his son."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24d.20",
      "source_sha256": "c58e5fffbfe00413",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. we have entreated you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24d.21",
      "source_sha256": "8c50deb36db818e3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. the preaching of the gospel, as if it had been heard from God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24d.22",
      "source_sha256": "1fb4d909e5358b6d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. it is not my own opinion to you; it is truly the word of God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24d.23",
      "source_sha256": "9bef33dcfd53c888",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "who believed in the preaching of Jesus and the apostles."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24d.24",
      "source_sha256": "0da1705ce3c7c13a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. from us."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24d.25",
      "source_sha256": "f3af4b1b01d869a2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. so that they may fill up."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.24d.26",
      "source_sha256": "cf6ce7892ad383af",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. we parted from you for a little while."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.1",
      "source_sha256": "15117dd538099384",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. if we could come."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.2",
      "source_sha256": "4e67011ed5a8220f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. by the tribulations of the persecutors, or by every adversary"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.3",
      "source_sha256": "0ad643ddc2d00e81",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. [?] it is she [the crown]; it will be from you [?] that we shall have the crown of glory on the day of judgement"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.4",
      "source_sha256": "acb312c0d737ca32",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. your perfection brings glory to us"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.5",
      "source_sha256": "c02980ed1d7fa7f0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. without knowledge of news from you"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.6",
      "source_sha256": "79f50fad8c7ad389",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. so that our household might come with knowledge of news from you"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.7",
      "source_sha256": "1eded1c591888d28",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. a teacher"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.8",
      "source_sha256": "e100a72a258f15af",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. it is for this that he is sent"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.9",
      "source_sha256": "08cbf73136cc9239",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. for he is steadfast, as indeed he is"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.10",
      "source_sha256": "2035ed5a3e2a8ffc",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. let my sufferings not be a trouble to you, or although they are suffered for the faith of Christ"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.11",
      "source_sha256": "018e1f6f45549299",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. it is not unknown to you"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.12",
      "source_sha256": "599777005117dde4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. it is to meet sufferings that we have come, or 'we are appointed', i.e. in anxiety for you"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.13",
      "source_sha256": "60c2ceaff1479c7d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. that we should be in tribulation"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.14",
      "source_sha256": "295ec226878aee1d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. as Christ suffered, and as he foretold to his apostles before he suffered, so that the faith of the apostles might be the stronger for it to endure tribulations"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.15",
      "source_sha256": "66938278c841ba98",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "beyond everyone"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.16",
      "source_sha256": "3a4d8ca2cad78686",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "through sadness, or to know whether he had tempted you"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.17",
      "source_sha256": "4580a501adfa88f3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. to know whether our labour was in vain"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.18",
      "source_sha256": "57bb065f5f2a1863",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. in prayers, or good testimony of us"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.19",
      "source_sha256": "c640d5051566d3a5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. if it is so with you"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.20",
      "source_sha256": "f5af8242031504c3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. it is for your benefit"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.21",
      "source_sha256": "b1b0877bc3c31b66",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. because of the aforesaid: since knowledge of news from you has come to us, and your faith and your love are good, etc."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.22",
      "source_sha256": "f3a1c703c503108c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. necessities, i.e. of chains"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.23",
      "source_sha256": "f71b5d1744c15628",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. since you are perfect"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.24",
      "source_sha256": "8c5868993a9c62b3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. your perfection is our life"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.25",
      "source_sha256": "5cd4ce03930d536f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. a great thing"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.26",
      "source_sha256": "b0a8301f2948bf4d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. that we may see you"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.27",
      "source_sha256": "c2c77197a67fbb13",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., our love is towards you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.28",
      "source_sha256": "4cd71e0b46df0a1f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "beyond every prayer"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.29",
      "source_sha256": "f9bf2c9a670f73ea",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., then it will not be a seeing without profit."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.30",
      "source_sha256": "eaa6120519dba86c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "if anything of your faith is lacking, it will be made good through our coming to you"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.31",
      "source_sha256": "7e3151b309a4a514",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "may God indeed clear [?] [the way] for us"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.32",
      "source_sha256": "2224b1e78dc72f7f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., another prayer"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.33",
      "source_sha256": "b0d99851f2b1e3d4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "before us"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.34",
      "source_sha256": "9562538e71650cc0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., each of you towards another"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.35",
      "source_sha256": "c65d61664da92da4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., we have abounded in love: as we have loved you, so let each of you love the other."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.36",
      "source_sha256": "b583311254f8ef8e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., it is for the increase of love"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.37",
      "source_sha256": "d0f89e9230d5b10c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., the way of going which you have seen"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.38",
      "source_sha256": "dcb5b1fb3774fcd3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., it will not be a scarcity [?] for the kingdom [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.39",
      "source_sha256": "b68268239e4581d8",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., we are pleased with you"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.40",
      "source_sha256": "f93f3aee4bd310eb",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., that which has been preached to you"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25a.41",
      "source_sha256": "295eaf75f0cde52d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., than what has been preached to you"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25b.1",
      "source_sha256": "43ec47d92f682270",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "you fulfil them, since you have knowledge [of them]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25b.2",
      "source_sha256": "e81e5f67fee7f56b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., this is the sanctification"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25b.3",
      "source_sha256": "d48bbb17c76722c5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., under obedience"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25b.4",
      "source_sha256": "aaaf839d6a09fa8e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., for it is thus with them"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25b.5",
      "source_sha256": "899d88e3f9946332",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., let him not deceive in any matter"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25b.6",
      "source_sha256": "4ea71f5467ad0252",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., God will exact vengeance for it afterwards"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25b.7",
      "source_sha256": "9032add9b5edc9e7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., of brotherly love"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25b.8",
      "source_sha256": "8f1c9f8d4ef806eb",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., than begging"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25b.9",
      "source_sha256": "618c9a6382b526eb",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., there are some things, then, that he rebukes here, namely idleness and laziness and begging; so he prays that these sins may not be among them."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25b.10",
      "source_sha256": "693c1471c4883986",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., strengthening"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25b.11",
      "source_sha256": "08b1e22a54fd49cd",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. so that you may not be living by begging"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25b.12",
      "source_sha256": "09486bf4fa186dbb",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. that is the 'honestly'"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25b.13",
      "source_sha256": "8b1729721d487eaa",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. an answer to others who had doubted the resurrection of the dead"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25b.14",
      "source_sha256": "5a78f60602c3fd2a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "This is his answer to the heretics; it is not easy to argue against it or to withstand it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25b.15",
      "source_sha256": "e20882595488fa4f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "for"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25b.16",
      "source_sha256": "1f68838d93d24390",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Pelagius: The apostle makes the day of the Lord receive them as if it found them in the body, i.e. here he joins those whom Doomsday will find alive with those who have died, and they will rise at the same hour."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25b.17",
      "source_sha256": "f507dddea5c7247f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Pelagius: Their resurrection will be as swift as our being taken up, i.e. as quick as their being snatched up is their awakening."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25b.18",
      "source_sha256": "4838d1880e87f769",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. sleep will not hold anyone back there"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25b.19",
      "source_sha256": "9676261b215c0e24",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. in the voice of God himself, as on Mount Sinai"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25b.20",
      "source_sha256": "47912efbfe40d7ef",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. foremost"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25b.21",
      "source_sha256": "3b379db8048c6e1c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. their resurrection will be more eminent"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25b.22",
      "source_sha256": "454df412738e8bb1",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. with the dead"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25b.23",
      "source_sha256": "8b99827a8a39bf3c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. in the clouds"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25b.24",
      "source_sha256": "9fa776dbbf78c0eb",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. in the air"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25b.25",
      "source_sha256": "5892666a75f6ae5b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. let this be a strengthening for you: that you will rise and will remain with the Lord"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25b.26",
      "source_sha256": "a651ab9338ac8cec",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. of the day of judgement, i.e. it will not be a long time, it will be an instant"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25b.27",
      "source_sha256": "87ca98d7b1f8b75a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "This is an answer to the thoughts of those who used to ask how soon [?] the resurrection would be."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25b.28",
      "source_sha256": "bdf3c2b561556378",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. as he (the thief) comes to seize his chance when he is not seen and not heard, so will God come to Doomsday when his coming is not expected."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25c.1",
      "source_sha256": "df06ea930c4ac9f9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "[?] ... will bear ... [?] ... thus ... [?] ... not certain when ... [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25c.2",
      "source_sha256": "30435b804017f6cb",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. it will not escape them"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25c.3",
      "source_sha256": "a59eeb7ce1cf335d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. to whom this is not a weakening [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25c.4",
      "source_sha256": "94533a1d1398406a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. without your knowing"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25c.5",
      "source_sha256": "90c468c7f2fb13b9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. without sins"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25c.6",
      "source_sha256": "0ec7896ce539f613",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. since you are sons of day and of light, let us not follow these things here [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25c.7",
      "source_sha256": "a0db177bd86d214e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. whatever kind (species) that may be [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25c.8",
      "source_sha256": "c7413995b50c8da3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "i.e. for us."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25c.9",
      "source_sha256": "cf1a6d1fd5547856",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "i.e. it is [?] for us."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25c.10",
      "source_sha256": "148dd68cc020bc75",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "i.e. that we may do the deeds that bring about salvation for us."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25c.11",
      "source_sha256": "302d461aa163bb24",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "i.e. this, then, is the grace of God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25c.12",
      "source_sha256": "8b21aaa3722eef57",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "i.e. whether we be in life or whether we be in death, let us be his. Otherwise: it is of the waking of bodies and the sleeping of bodies, so that they should not think that sleeping would be forbidden when he said, 'Let us not sleep.'"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25c.13",
      "source_sha256": "cf5b18b2017ed03b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "i.e. because resurrection and the kingdom await you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25c.14",
      "source_sha256": "ab2d72a802ca40c0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "i.e. this is what you do; or: that you are not [?], as you do."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25c.15",
      "source_sha256": "9663c9257a2b6cfe",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "i.e. who are set over you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25c.16",
      "source_sha256": "0f4f88aef7d12c1f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "Beyond everyone, for it is for your benefit that they exist."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25c.17",
      "source_sha256": "17b63629754d9c7a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "i.e. do what they tell you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25c.18",
      "source_sha256": "573fa3718e193d14",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "All this below is a rebuke against them."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25c.19",
      "source_sha256": "9ce9798d0cc2a2f8",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "i.e. the idle folk, who love begging from everyone."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25c.20",
      "source_sha256": "207924210bc30e74",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "i.e. this is the patience that he spoke of before."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25c.21",
      "source_sha256": "c4f14610c4f48d59",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "i.e. forgiveness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25c.22",
      "source_sha256": "d9ffd20670dc0350",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "i.e. for vengeance is evil; forgiveness is good."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25c.23",
      "source_sha256": "1f8b91cf76ede9ba",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "Question: what is prayer without ceasing? Not hard. Some say that it would be the celebration of the canonical hours, which is not true. Question: what is it, then? Not hard: when all the members are turned to good deeds and evil deeds are taken away from them, so that they then cry out to God when they do good; i.e. the eyes are turned to beholding good, as Job says, 'I made a covenant with my eyes,' etc."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25c.24",
      "source_sha256": "79bb78a01e446423",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "The good things that I preach, fulfil them."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25c.25",
      "source_sha256": "46f36e8c91d221a0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "i.e. that is, in the preaching."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25c.26",
      "source_sha256": "7fe2c1544e455b1c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "i.e. the chief part of the soul, by which we understand; or the Holy Spirit, i.e. as he has been given to us."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25c.27",
      "source_sha256": "c1172d523967228f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "i.e. without [?] of vice."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25c.28",
      "source_sha256": "65fc2d9079792333",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "i.e. God is faithful; what he has promised will be true."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25c.29",
      "source_sha256": "1282b48086de34cf",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "i.e. I beseech you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25c.30",
      "source_sha256": "b43f71c57e1041b7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "i.e. that it be read."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25c.31",
      "source_sha256": "3d69374b362e7514",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "i.e. so that it may not be unknown to any of them."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/1thess#Wb.25c.32",
      "source_sha256": "82579ecc1934b32c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. without exception"
    }
  ]
}
